{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01491","headline":"舞曲歌辞 白紵辞三首 二 · 李白","name":"舞曲歌辞 白紵辞三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月寒江清夜沈沈，美人一笑千黄金。\n垂罗舞縠扬哀音，郢中白雪且莫吟，子夜吴歌动君心。\n动君心，冀君赏。\n愿作天池双鸯鸯，一朝飞去青云上。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01491.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01491","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}